Commit:     Brendan Abolivier <brendan@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Mon Apr 27 16:10:55 2026 +0000

    Bug 2016805 - Part 2: Move OperationSender to protocols_shared. r=jtracey

    This patch also fixes a few minor details such as removing the use of `RefCell`
    in `OperationSender` and clearing out unused dependencies in `ews_xpcom`. It
    also makes some changes to the trait introduced in the previous patch in this
    stack regarding error handling. I'm not a fan of all the `map_err`s this
    introduces in `make_and_send_request`, but this feels like the lesser evil if we
    don't want to force a bunch of unnecessary compatibility constraints onto
    implementors of `ResponseProcessor`.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D296367

